TRAIN @ Elwynn Forest, 44.4, 66.2 | Maximillian Crowe, in the basement of the inn: level 8 spells if you are 8 (Curse of Agony, Fear). Put Curse of Agony on every enemy after Corruption. Fear the second enemy whenever two come, but never near other packs: a feared enemy runs and brings friends back
N Make Linen Bandages from your Linen Cloth | Sell and repair at the smithy before you go to the lake

# --- Crystal Lake: the fishermen ---
A 99127 | Jason Mathers, one of the two fishermen on the west shore of Crystal Lake, just east of Goldshire
A 99143 | Lee Brown, next to him
C 99127 @ Elwynn Forest, 50.5, 65.5 | Check the fishing traps in the shallow water of Crystal Lake (their spots are not published: look for traps along the shore and in the shallows, starting at the fishermen) until you have 7 Half-Eaten Fish
C 99143,112 @ Elwynn Forest, 54.2, 66.7 | The murloc camp is on the east shore, across the lake. Pick up 6 Shiny Junk from the camp and kill Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners (6-7) for 4 Crystal Kelp Fronds. Kill 7 Murlocs and 4 Streamrunners while you are here: Jason asks for exactly that next. Murlocs run for help at low health: keep Corruption on every one so a runner dies on the way, and Shadow Bolt it as it turns. Do not Fear in the camp: a feared murloc brings the others
